# PXD014739 — Arabidopsis histone PTM reference workflow

## Dataset

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| PRIDE accession | PXD014739 |
| Organism | *Arabidopsis thaliana* (Col-0) |
| Sample | Acid-extracted histones, propionylated |
| Acquisition | DDA (data-dependent) |
| Instrument | Q Exactive (Thermo) |

## Files in this directory

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `histone_ratios_PXD014739.xls` | Cohort-level PTM ratio table (OutputTogether output) |
| `PXD014739_XIC_gallery_subset_cropped.pdf` | Representative XIC traces for selected peptides |
| `paper_PXD014739.pdf` | Associated publication (open access) |

## How to reproduce

```matlab
% 1. Download RAW files from PRIDE: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/pride/archive/projects/PXD014739
% 2. Place them in a folder (e.g., data/PXD014739/)
% 3. Run the AT bundle:
cd bundles/AT/src
EpiProfile
% 4. When prompted, point to the RAW folder
% 5. Output appears in data/PXD014739/histone_layouts/
```

## Parameters used

- Mass tolerance: 10 ppm (default, set in `check_otherparas.m`)
- Debug mode: off (`ndebug = 0`)
- Figures: enabled (`nfigure = 1`)
